{title: Jind Mahi}
{artist: Diljit Dosanjh}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] Door door [D] kyun ein sajjna,        Zara [C] kol te [Em] aa
[Em] Saahan vich [D] saah paake,        Aaja [C] mujh mein [Em] samaa
[Em] Ho jind mahi aaja ve,        Ho seene [C] laa ja ve
Ho dil vich [D] agg jo tu laayi,        Uss nu [Em] bujha ja ve
Ki [Em] dassan, ki [D] mehsoos karaan,        Jadon [C] kol tu?n [Em] hove?in
Oh mera [Em] dil nahion lagda,        [D] Ik pal vi jadon [C] door tu [Em] hove
Main [Em] khaali tann haan,        Rooh [C] tere vich ve
Hor naa [D] tarfaa sajjna,        Mujh mein [Em] samaa ja ve
[Em] Ho jind mahi aaja ve,        Ho seene [C] laa ja ve
Ho dil vich [D] agg jo tu laayi,        Uss nu [Em] bujha ja ve
